    "title": "Rethinking Currency Devaluation: How African Importers Are Building Domestic Resiliency Through Reverse Integration",
    "subtitle": "Relying on imported raw materials when your revenue is in local currency is financial roulette. Here is how leading FMCG manufacturers slashed FX exposure by 40% in under 18 months.",
