    "title": "Stop Blaming Middlemen: The Vital Economic Function of Rural Grain Aggregators",
    "subtitle": "Aggregators are often vilified by politicians for price gouging, but our field data proves they absorb massive transport risks, finance smallholder farmers before banks will, and prevent post-harvest spoilage by deploying immediate off-take cash.",
